# The local models this machine should have — `llm update` installs exactly these.
#
# role      tag                       download GB
#
# Roles: coder (llm code), fast (llm fast), reasoner (llm reason, and the
# default for non-code prompts), general, embed (search vectors only; never
# answers a prompt). The first model listed for a role is
# the one that role gets. Size is the download size from ollama.com, used only
# to check disk before a pull. Never list a :cloud tag; llm refuses them.
#
# Only one fits in 32 GB of memory at a time; switching costs a reload.
reasoner    qwen3.8:27b               18
coder       qwen3.6:27b-coding        18
# Enabled 2026-10-15: 125 GB free. (Was off 2026-10-06 at 40 GB free; all three would have left
# ~15.) Without a fast model, `llm fast` uses the coder.
fast        qwen3.6:35b-a3b-coding    24
# Added 2026-11-06 for local search over notes: 0.6 GB, stays loaded beside any one chat model.
embed       qwen3-embedding:0.6b      1
# Kept for other local projects that embed with it; listed second, so it never wins the role.
embed       nomic-embed-text:latest   1
